  "contract": "rev_20261027_84_coa_hillsbrad_restore.sql restores the Hillsbrad Foothills quests the server lacked, from the Ascension questcache.wdb captures and the client QuestSuperTrack data. This case covers the 25 quests of Tarren Mill and the Shadow Tower: each is taken natively from its giver, in chain order so every PrevQuestID gate applies, its objectives are fixture-completed (objective items are granted, kill and event credit is set), and it is handed in natively at its ender, which must reward it. For Want of Mana 255128 is given by Priestess Mar'lynn Evermorne 312429 and ends at Asteria the Soulcleaver 312428, and In Fear of Death 1377 ends at Bergamont Lestern 312402 (its CompletedText); each is first offered to the wrong NPC, which must not reward it. A Report for the Dark Lady 255136 has no giver until the Silverpine Blighthollow chain is restored, so it is carried as a fixture and handed in at Apothecary Lydon 2216.",
